==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*3 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawns as the boss.
**25 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**30 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
**5 [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**3 [[Teacher Bear]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A fairly easy stage, but it could be considered difficult for people who are very early into the game, so try to get at least midway through [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1 before attempting this stage.

